---
import { href } from '../lib/constants.mjs';
---

<figure class="home-architecture" aria-labelledby="home-map-heading">
  <h3 id="home-map-heading">How the knowledge assistant fits together.</h3>
  <div class="home-map-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Simplified knowledge assistant architecture" tabindex="0">
    <svg class="home-map" viewBox="0 0 780 590" role="img" aria-labelledby="home-map-title home-map-description" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <title id="home-map-title">Knowledge assistant system map</title>
      <desc id="home-map-description">The browser UI reaches the assistant directly. MCP clients enter through LiteLLM and FastMCP. The assistant produces an answer using Retrieval MCP, model providers and PostgreSQL conversation checkpoints. Manual ingestion separately updates the prepared knowledge used by retrieval.</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="home-map-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#9db6c5" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="home-map-data-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#79cfb2" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="home-map-manual-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#e0b775" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <text class="map-kicker" x="24" y="43">CLIENTS</text>
      <text class="map-kicker" x="210" y="43">MCP ENTRANCE</text>
      <text class="map-kicker" x="420" y="43">ASSISTANT</text>
      <text class="map-kicker" x="620" y="43">RESULT</text>

      <g class="map-edges" fill="none" stroke="#9db6c5" stroke-width="2.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" marker-end="url(#home-map-arrow)">
        <path d="M 184 109 H 400 V 158 H 420" />
        <path d="M 184 223 H 210" />
        <path d="M 382 223 H 400 V 187 H 420" />
        <path d="M 594 174 H 620" />
        <path d="M 453 227 V 320 H 111 V 360" />
        <path d="M 500 227 V 330 H 305 V 360" />
        <path d="M 547 227 V 340 H 499 V 360" />
      </g>
      <path d="M 111 442 V 475 H 328 V 500" fill="none" stroke="#79cfb2" stroke-width="2.3" marker-end="url(#home-map-data-arrow)" />
      <path d="M 198 536 H 218" fill="none" stroke="#e0b775" stroke-width="2.3" marker-end="url(#home-map-manual-arrow)" />

      <g class="map-node map-node--client">
        <rect x="24" y="70" width="160" height="78" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="42" y="104">Browser UI</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="42" y="128">Direct HTTP / AG-UI</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--client">
        <rect x="24" y="184" width="160" height="78" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="42" y="218">MCP clients</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="42" y="242">Tool conversations</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--entrance">
        <rect x="210" y="184" width="172" height="78" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="228" y="218">MCP entrance</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="228" y="242">LiteLLM → FastMCP</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--assistant">
        <rect x="420" y="122" width="174" height="105" rx="18" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="438" y="163">Assistant</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="438" y="188">Coordination + agent</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--result">
        <rect x="620" y="133" width="135" height="82" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="638" y="168">Answer</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="638" y="193">Inspectable</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--service">
        <rect x="24" y="360" width="174" height="82" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="42" y="397">Retrieval MCP</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="42" y="422">Search / read</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--service">
        <rect x="218" y="360" width="174" height="82" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="236" y="397">Model providers</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="236" y="422">Inference</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--storage">
        <rect x="412" y="360" width="174" height="82" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="430" y="397">PostgreSQL</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="430" y="422">Checkpoints</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--manual">
        <rect x="24" y="500" width="174" height="72" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="42" y="532">Manual ingestion</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="42" y="556">Operator run</text>
      </g>
      <g class="map-node map-node--storage">
        <rect x="218" y="500" width="220" height="72" rx="16" />
        <text class="map-node-title" x="236" y="532">Qdrant + documents</text>
        <text class="map-node-detail" x="236" y="556">Prepared knowledge</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <p>A simplified view of the published Harness architecture. Browser requests enter directly; MCP clients use the gateway. Manual ingestion prepares knowledge outside the conversation.</p>
    <a href={href('/architecture/#system-map')}>Explore the full architecture <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .home-architecture { width: min(100%, 760px); margin: 32px 0; }
  .home-architecture h3 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .home-map-scroll { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: #0a1f30; }
  .home-map-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--teal-light); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .home-map { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; font-family: inherit; }
  .map-kicker { fill: #91aaba; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .map-node rect { fill: #102a3c; stroke: #607e90; stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .map-node--entrance rect { fill: #252542; stroke: #9a8de9; }
  .map-node--assistant rect { fill: #123c48; stroke: #78e1cd; stroke-width: 2; }
  .map-node--result rect { fill: #1b3d41; stroke: #78e1cd; }
  .map-node--service rect { fill: #122f48; stroke: #6ba9db; }
  .map-node--storage rect { fill: #113830; stroke: #79cfb2; }
  .map-node--manual rect { fill: #3b2c1b; stroke: #e0b775; }
  .map-node-title { fill: #eef7fb; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
  .map-node-detail { fill: #b6ccd6; font-size: 13px; }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px 24px; margin-top: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }
  figcaption p { max-width: 72ch; margin: 0; }
  figcaption a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 44px; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .home-architecture::after { content: 'Scroll sideways to explore the map'; display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; } }
</style>
